                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "It tries really hard to be an atmospheric sci-fi survival horror game, but it falls flat on almost every level. The movement feels clunky, enemy combat is a frustrating chore, and performance issues constantly ruin any dread the environment builds up. You spend more time fighting sluggish controls and confusing level design than actual space monsters. Honestly, you're better off replaying Dead Space instead.",
